	<p style="text-align:center;font-size:25px;font-weight:700">The Salvation Army’s Older Adult Ministries creates welcoming opportunities for older adults to connect, grow in faith, and enjoy life in community.</p>
	<p style="text-align:left;font-size:25px;padding-top:33px">Through fellowship, special activities, Bible study, and recreation at Camp CONNRI, participants can build friendships, discover new interests, and find a place to belong.</p>
	<p style="text-align:left;font-size:25px;padding-top:20px;padding-bottom:21px">Throughout the week, participants enjoy delicious meals, fun games, boat rides, crafts, and Bible Study. Programs and activities vary by climate. Anyone aged 55 and older is eligible to register.
</p>
